WEBVTT

00:09.200 --> 00:12.010
The beasts are disappearing from the forest...

00:12.010 --> 00:17.280
Yes... The beasts have all gone away within the past few days.

00:17.280 --> 00:21.250
It's possible that the Magic Territory on this island is changing.

00:21.250 --> 00:24.450
A country is rooted to the magic residing within the land.

00:24.450 --> 00:30.360
Soon the water's flow, the land's bounty, and even the air itself will be affected...

00:32.360 --> 00:36.260
Agito is planning to place
Lady Inori upon the throne.

00:36.260 --> 00:40.970
You were simply used to cover up his intentions!

00:40.970 --> 00:43.040
I'll try and talk with Agito.

00:43.040 --> 00:45.310
Let's hurry to Shuka.

00:45.310 --> 00:47.280
Thank goodness!

00:47.280 --> 00:50.250
I thought we had gotten separated, dear brother!

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Please don't let go of me again.

00:59.090 --> 01:02.060
"Meanwhile... \ D'natia embassy"

01:02.320 --> 01:03.390
Bishop.

01:03.390 --> 01:05.390
Bishop Enumael.

01:05.390 --> 01:08.330
Inori is nowhere to be found.

01:08.330 --> 01:10.430
Sir Sweallow...

01:10.430 --> 01:13.400
I'm sorry I haven't greeted you yet, Ambassador.

01:13.400 --> 01:17.640
I received orders from our country to bring Bishop Enumael

01:17.640 --> 01:19.910
and the Imperial to Shuka immediately.

01:19.910 --> 01:21.080
Where's Ibuki?!

01:21.080 --> 01:22.610
What's this monster doing here?

01:22.610 --> 01:25.580
She's a member of the combined expedition.

01:25.580 --> 01:28.780
Ibuki is the name of the other Imperial.

01:28.780 --> 01:30.410
Ibuki isn't around, either?

01:32.850 --> 01:34.960
Close this structure immediately!

01:34.960 --> 01:37.290
Yes.

01:37.290 --> 01:40.100
What's the matter?

01:40.100 --> 01:42.100
The name of this country is Nil Kamui.

01:42.100 --> 01:44.000
It has been three years

01:44.000 --> 01:47.100
since this very small island country was invaded by the great country Kouran.

01:47.100 --> 01:49.340
Despite being Nil Kamui's ally,

01:49.340 --> 01:54.680
D'natia avoided direct conflict with Kouran and maintained a stance of neutrality.

01:54.680 --> 01:57.210
After the Seven Year War ended,

01:57.210 --> 02:01.380
peaceful rule of the land between the two countries was established, with D'natia

02:01.380 --> 02:04.650
keeping a watchful eye on
Kouran's occupation of Nil Kamui.

02:04.650 --> 02:10.130
But one day, this island must be returned to its rightful owner.

02:10.130 --> 02:13.160
Holy Era 285, October...

02:13.160 --> 02:17.190
Conflict is about to begin again for Nil Kamui...

02:19.300 --> 02:24.070
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

02:24.070 --> 02:28.510
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

02:28.510 --> 02:30.640
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

02:41.420 --> 02:50.770
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

02:50.770 --> 02:51.770
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

02:51.770 --> 02:53.870
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:53.870 --> 02:56.940
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:56.940 --> 02:59.170
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:59.170 --> 03:01.380
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

03:01.380 --> 03:05.610
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

03:05.610 --> 03:11.850
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

03:11.850 --> 03:17.360
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

03:17.360 --> 03:22.430
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

03:22.430 --> 03:28.100
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

03:28.100 --> 03:33.710
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

03:33.710 --> 03:37.750
<i>The ending world</i>

03:37.750 --> 03:42.620
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

03:50.290 --> 03:54.430
Weren't those found near Bishop Enumael...?

03:54.430 --> 03:55.800
A Holy Spirit...

03:55.800 --> 04:01.270
It's a seal given by the Church to protect its bearer from attack.

04:01.270 --> 04:06.410
Sir Sweallow has you for a partner, so he probably doesn't need one.

04:06.410 --> 04:09.640
The Holy Spirit is valuable, so I'm sure he just sold it.

04:09.640 --> 04:11.650
I, on the other hand, am free to use.

04:11.650 --> 04:16.920
Being close to someone may prevent you from seeing the obvious.

04:16.920 --> 04:19.920
He really thinks of you...

04:19.920 --> 04:22.580
...as someone precious...

04:24.090 --> 04:25.930
So, Mashiro--

04:25.930 --> 04:29.700
No... A Returned One killed Bishop Enumael?

04:29.700 --> 04:34.270
In that case, it makes sense that Inori and the others have disappeared.

04:30.500 --> 04:33.970
"Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

04:34.270 --> 04:39.110
Does this clear the doubt placed upon us?

04:39.110 --> 04:45.610
Like I was saying, this is Agito's scheme to make Kouran and D'natia confront each other.

04:45.610 --> 04:49.280
Leader of Ten Thousand, Byakuei, was it?

04:49.280 --> 04:54.490
The moment you arrived in Haiga, our bishop was killed.

04:54.490 --> 04:56.360
It seems too timely...

04:56.360 --> 04:59.790
Nah, I don't think he's a bad...

04:59.790 --> 05:01.400
...person...

05:01.400 --> 05:02.830
Sir Simeon.

05:02.830 --> 05:06.830
Our spiritual mother would like to have a meeting

05:06.830 --> 05:10.540
with D'natia's representative in regards to the rulership of Nil Kamui.

05:10.540 --> 05:15.040
You mean the legend who ruled
Kouran for over 3,000 years...?

05:15.040 --> 05:16.180
Legend?

05:16.180 --> 05:19.650
Not at all. In fact, she's here right now in the capital of this island, Shuka.

05:19.650 --> 05:23.920
I don't think it's right for the fate of Nil Kamui to be determined by those two countries.

05:23.920 --> 05:27.720
Your presence is, of course, requested as well, Sir Ka Grava.

05:29.690 --> 05:32.760
The leader of the revolutionary army, Agito...

05:32.760 --> 05:36.830
...is controlling the two Imperials for his own purposes...

05:36.830 --> 05:40.600
D'natia was tricked by him once before.

05:40.600 --> 05:44.670
This is not the time for Kouran and
D'natia to be competing for power.

05:44.670 --> 05:49.610
As soon as I get approval from our country, we will have the meeting in Shuka.

05:49.610 --> 05:51.510
W-Wait a minute!

05:51.510 --> 05:53.350
A meeting in Shuka?

05:53.350 --> 05:55.420
So what about the combined expedition?

05:55.420 --> 05:57.890
Kouran... D'natia... The revolutionary army...

05:57.890 --> 06:03.360
We believed having these three forces join the
Red Dragon expedition would lead to peace.

06:03.360 --> 06:08.350
But with the revolutionary army plotting in secret, there's no meaning to it anymore.

06:11.800 --> 06:15.030
"Between Haiga and Shuka \ Woodlands"

06:18.270 --> 06:22.710
As things stand now, there's no way Kouran or D'natia would approve Inori as king.

06:22.710 --> 06:24.200
Then...

06:25.380 --> 06:28.220
Both of you, please stay behind!

06:28.220 --> 06:29.710
Go...!

06:47.000 --> 06:50.100
Val! What's the matter, Val?!

06:50.100 --> 06:53.570
Unable to exert your power, and feeling sick as well, aren't you?

06:53.570 --> 06:56.410
So the attendants were Returned Ones too?!

06:56.410 --> 07:00.480
It's because our State Magic
Territory was tainted.

07:00.480 --> 07:04.820
The beast you're bonded to is weakened, too.

07:04.820 --> 07:08.290
Dear brother, this is how they're invading us.

07:08.290 --> 07:13.460
The real purpose of the combined expedition is to take Red Dragon's power away.

07:13.460 --> 07:16.430
But it is a fact that Red Dragon went mad.

07:16.430 --> 07:19.100
It incinerated the people and the villages!

07:19.100 --> 07:21.500
Well, they deserved it.

07:21.500 --> 07:23.770
Red Dragon is angry.

07:23.770 --> 07:28.870
Angry at the powerless citizens who gave Nil Kamui over to the invaders.

07:35.280 --> 07:36.770
Kill me!

07:40.460 --> 07:41.990
How sad...

07:41.990 --> 07:43.860
You're no king!

07:43.860 --> 07:47.030
Only Ibuki can use Red Dragon's flames!

07:47.030 --> 07:52.490
That's right... It's important to you that my dear brother become king.

07:54.040 --> 07:56.540
Only because Ibuki is fit to become king.

07:56.540 --> 08:03.210
You were created as a worthless
Bound One, and your days are numbered.

08:03.210 --> 08:08.080
But you're offering your life to my dear brother as something precious.

08:08.080 --> 08:16.520
Only then can you say in satisfaction that you lived and died as the king's sword and friend.

08:16.520 --> 08:20.660
Huh? What? Are you trying to make me laugh?

08:20.660 --> 08:23.100
No matter how much you adore my dear brother...

08:23.100 --> 08:24.100
No!

08:24.100 --> 08:28.240
He sees you as but a mere attendant.

08:28.240 --> 08:33.070
That's why your life isn't worth offering to Red Dragon.

08:33.070 --> 08:35.710
N-No...

08:35.710 --> 08:38.780
You'll just have a pitiful death!

08:38.780 --> 08:40.940
You'll die... for nothing!

08:43.950 --> 08:46.890
Dear brother, you should kill her.
After all, it's her--

08:46.890 --> 08:48.220
Stop it already!

08:48.220 --> 08:51.760
Eykha, go back to Ka Grava.

08:51.760 --> 08:54.960
Ibuki, you didn't kill me the last time, either.

08:54.960 --> 09:01.070
Is it because... you think my life has no value?

09:01.070 --> 09:02.560
Eykha...

09:10.280 --> 09:13.740
I don't consider you to be my blade.

09:20.890 --> 09:23.390
I want to protect you...

09:23.390 --> 09:26.830
But... I don't have the right to do that.

09:28.160 --> 09:31.060
Ibuki...!

09:32.670 --> 09:35.100
"Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

09:35.240 --> 09:37.740
Quite impressive...

09:37.740 --> 09:40.810
It's the best Wu Xing Ti that Kouran has.

09:40.810 --> 09:43.910
The item you gave me is that valuable.

09:43.910 --> 09:45.410
And this...?

09:45.410 --> 09:47.780
It's the dragon's claw.

09:49.120 --> 09:54.290
I'm sure it's the best weapon available to defeat Red Dragon...

09:54.290 --> 09:59.460
It's unusual to see you showing interest in someone else's property.

09:59.460 --> 10:01.620
You may be right.

10:04.270 --> 10:07.800
Thank goodness. It looks like the operation was a success.

10:07.800 --> 10:08.940
And...?

10:08.940 --> 10:11.270
Ah, well...

10:11.270 --> 10:13.840
The combined expedition was just to buy time...

10:13.840 --> 10:18.210
...and behind it was the political posturing of all the countries involved.

10:19.310 --> 10:23.480
But that kind of behind-the-scenes stuff doesn't concern us, right?

10:23.480 --> 10:27.290
Yes... We just have to continue our mission.

10:27.290 --> 10:28.860
Well, let's go, then.

10:28.860 --> 10:30.190
Yes...

10:30.190 --> 10:31.860
--To save Ibuki.
--To find Red Dragon.

10:31.860 --> 10:34.030
--Huh?
--What?

10:34.030 --> 10:37.130
I didn't understand what you said just now...

10:37.130 --> 10:41.040
Depending on the results from the peace meeting in Shuka, Ibuki may be in danger.

10:41.040 --> 10:42.800
We should find and protect him before then.

10:42.800 --> 10:46.340
But our goal is to find Red Dragon...

10:46.340 --> 10:49.140
No... I'll be upfront with you.

10:49.140 --> 10:51.510
Don't we need to kill it?

10:51.510 --> 10:52.910
Yeah...

10:52.910 --> 10:58.490
Well, it's clear that killing
Red Dragon would benefit me, too.

10:58.490 --> 11:04.430
But if I was asked whether the benefit was worth ruining a single child's fate,

11:04.430 --> 11:07.160
my answer would be "no."

11:07.160 --> 11:11.500
Honestly speaking, I haven't been attached to any single thing my whole life.

11:11.500 --> 11:14.200
That applies to Red Dragon's life, too.

11:14.200 --> 11:17.510
Quite an interesting person, isn't he, Lou?

11:17.510 --> 11:23.210
But if we stay with him, I'll be able to consume the Imperials and Black Dragon Knights...

11:23.210 --> 11:28.020
I think I said this before, Lou, but I can't casually touch you...

11:28.020 --> 11:32.850
Sir Sweallow, I will kill Red Dragon.

11:32.850 --> 11:34.860
I don't get it.

11:34.860 --> 11:38.930
Why are you so persistent in going after Red Dragon? That's...

11:38.930 --> 11:44.600
That is like asking me why my heart is beating.

11:44.600 --> 11:50.100
In other words, you're the opposite of me-- you form very strong attachments.

11:50.100 --> 11:55.810
Well, I have known you were like this ever since we first met.

11:55.810 --> 12:01.920
I think I was looking forward to having similar emotions grow within me from being with you.

12:01.920 --> 12:05.290
Your expectations will not be betrayed...

12:05.290 --> 12:07.250
If you'd like, we can...

12:07.250 --> 12:08.750
...do it here...

12:09.760 --> 12:11.730
Lou Chun Wah.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.160
Did I bother you?

12:13.160 --> 12:16.930
No... Is there something you need from me, Leader of Ten Thousand?

12:16.930 --> 12:20.460
Yes... I have a message from Líng Mŭ.

12:24.570 --> 12:26.840
Are you all right, Sir Sweallow?!

12:26.840 --> 12:29.110
Ah, um, it's not what you think, and...

12:29.110 --> 12:31.350
I understand.

12:31.350 --> 12:37.450
You're going to protect Ibuki even if it gets in the way of lifting your curse, right?

12:37.450 --> 12:42.290
Oh, shoot. Did Meryl say something weird again?

12:42.290 --> 12:47.760
You've suffered more than enough, even in your childhood.

12:47.760 --> 12:49.360
And yet...

12:49.360 --> 12:54.770
That's why I don't want to see any more children suffer.

13:00.810 --> 13:02.300
Be safe.

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
"Holy Spirit \ A spirit-like existence which

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
is born from D'natia's 'Creation Magic.'

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
This magic employs the same method used

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
in creating Bound Ones. By implementing a

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
Holy Spirit, homogeneous levels of magic power

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
can be exhibited. Holy Spirits can be used

13:04.780 --> 13:08.510
as a faithful servant, or to spare one's life."

13:10.020 --> 13:13.450
You were planning to kill that
Black Dragon Knight, were you?

13:13.450 --> 13:15.220
Is there a problem?

13:15.220 --> 13:17.690
I guess the rumors are true.

13:17.690 --> 13:21.330
You became a cold-blooded assassin after you stole that sword of yours

13:21.330 --> 13:23.490
from a general that favored you.

13:25.300 --> 13:30.470
Supposedly, it has something to do with Líng Mŭ...

13:30.470 --> 13:36.980
It's said to be so sharp that the previous owner tested its blade against his subordinates.

13:36.980 --> 13:39.470
There's no telling what would happen to me.

13:46.850 --> 13:50.260
Will you be the one to entertain me...?

13:52.930 --> 13:55.260
I want you...

13:59.270 --> 14:02.930
I heard you were charmed by the sword and became its slave...

14:05.710 --> 14:11.380
I'm surprised that the Leader of
Ten Thousand would believe such a rumor...

14:11.380 --> 14:13.440
I have word from Líng Mŭ.

14:16.020 --> 14:21.080
Even if you are the only one left, take Red Dragon's life.

14:24.120 --> 14:25.760
Ah, the dragon's claw...

14:25.760 --> 14:30.630
We didn't tell anyone we were heading to Shuka, so we can't go back to get it now.

14:30.630 --> 14:33.370
It could be a problem if it gets in Lou's hands.

14:33.370 --> 14:37.610
Nah, I don't think she cares about other people's weapons.

14:37.610 --> 14:41.110
To be safe, let me secure it.

14:41.110 --> 14:43.140
Thanks, but...

14:43.140 --> 14:44.880
Sir Sweallow.

14:44.880 --> 14:49.150
I believe it's for the best that everyone here live in happiness,

14:49.150 --> 14:53.750
be they from Kouran, D'natia, or Nil Kamui.

14:53.750 --> 14:56.090
Such thinking would make me unfit to be a member of the force...

14:56.090 --> 14:57.290
Not at all.

14:57.290 --> 15:01.330
I thought the combined expedition would lead the way to such an ideal.

15:01.330 --> 15:04.570
But that wasn't the case for Lou Chun Wah!

15:04.570 --> 15:07.470
She is... evil.

15:07.470 --> 15:09.160
Ulrika...

15:16.080 --> 15:17.580
I'm sorry.

15:17.580 --> 15:20.780
I want to move quickly, so I only need the bare minimum to be on board.

15:20.780 --> 15:23.320
Yes, we understand.

15:23.320 --> 15:26.250
Would this be the item you've asked for?

15:26.250 --> 15:28.620
Yes, it is...

15:28.620 --> 15:30.320
Dragon's claw...

15:30.320 --> 15:32.790
So, making it seem like they parted ways,

15:32.790 --> 15:35.990
only to converge later with that Black Dragon Knight...

15:46.040 --> 15:48.700
I'm worrying too much...

15:58.220 --> 16:02.120
Your fate is sealed, even if you are a Black Dragon Knight!

16:03.720 --> 16:05.390
Smiling, I see...

16:06.790 --> 16:08.490
Lou! The shadow!

16:11.000 --> 16:12.730
A familiar?!

16:14.640 --> 16:16.160
That's...?!

16:21.510 --> 16:24.640
I didn't expect she would harbor such a monster in the shadows!

16:39.560 --> 16:42.830
I sensed nothing from it...

16:42.830 --> 16:45.030
Dark, Lou.

16:45.030 --> 16:47.200
The Black Dragon's attribute is "Dark."

16:47.200 --> 16:50.370
Its divine protection is greatest during the night.

16:50.370 --> 16:52.110
We should hurry.

16:52.110 --> 16:53.870
The sun is about to set.

16:53.870 --> 16:55.240
If that happens...

16:55.240 --> 16:58.540
Everything will be covered in dark...

17:29.140 --> 17:31.370
Contract seal, release!

17:33.280 --> 17:36.050
Bring upon me the power of Black Dragon!

17:59.310 --> 18:01.840
Well, well...

18:01.840 --> 18:06.970
None can resist your charm, my lord.

18:09.920 --> 18:14.090
You can't hold back your desire for this sword now.

18:14.090 --> 18:15.580
Right?

18:22.630 --> 18:27.700
Enjoy the soul of the Black
Dragon Knight Ulrika Ledezma!

18:27.700 --> 18:29.190
She's mine!

18:36.680 --> 18:37.710
My lord!

18:37.710 --> 18:41.380
She has a Holy Spirit on her.

18:41.380 --> 18:42.870
Holy Spirit?

18:44.320 --> 18:47.020
It can take a fatal blow.

18:47.020 --> 18:50.460
In other words, it's like a sacrifice.

18:50.460 --> 18:53.890
She has more than one life...?

18:53.890 --> 18:56.730
So the pain made you regain your consciousness.

18:56.730 --> 19:01.070
But my lord's charm can't be lifted so easily.

19:01.070 --> 19:04.530
Then I just have to increase the pain...

19:06.570 --> 19:10.310
You'll go to such lengths to refuse my lord?!

19:10.310 --> 19:11.800
Now!

19:16.920 --> 19:20.850
I won't be charmed by such trickery!

19:20.850 --> 19:26.230
Because I already saw the most beautiful thing in this world!!

19:26.230 --> 19:30.560
His fate to lose all that comes within his grasp allows him

19:30.560 --> 19:33.260
to put his life at stake for the future of others...

19:34.200 --> 19:38.910
If he will protect the children, then I will...

19:38.910 --> 19:41.340
You love him that much?

19:41.340 --> 19:44.870
It's not like he can even touch you...

20:10.770 --> 20:16.210
The Magic Territory of this ocean has greatly shifted towards Kouran.

20:16.210 --> 20:20.150
Being from D'natia, you must be very uncomfortable now.

20:25.590 --> 20:31.120
So, still trying to protect your master?

20:31.120 --> 20:32.790
How admirable...

20:51.680 --> 20:56.310
There is nothing more beautiful than my lord.

21:15.140 --> 21:16.760
Sweallow...

21:25.980 --> 21:28.450
We've been had.

21:28.450 --> 21:33.520
The dragon's claw must have been sent through other means...

21:33.520 --> 21:36.560
She sacrificed herself...?

21:36.560 --> 21:42.390
I see... You wanted to become his Holy Spirit...

21:45.870 --> 21:46.330
"Act 10"

21:47.300 --> 21:50.570
"Act 10 \ Narrow Escape from Death"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:27.330
"Act 11"

23:27.100 --> 23:30.640
Act 11: "Pandemonium."

23:30.640 --> 23:35.110
The revolutionary army's fire burns strong, as do Red Dragon's flames.

23:35.110 --> 23:39.670
Nothing can escape the dragon's flame...
